    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then the sum to infinity of the following series&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;is",
